</td><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="75.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_43e3ba05-9d31-6468-bf23-cfdbba9aa22f" id="_43e3ba05-9d31-6468-bf23-cfdbba9aa22f"></a>ADEOfAbstractDynamizer acts as a hook to define properties within an ADE that are to be added to AbstractDynamizer.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="25.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_4e8e535e-0166-0aa2-94f4-6126be06ca67" id="_4e8e535e-0166-0aa2-94f4-6126be06ca67"></a><a href="#section-EAID_B187B8F9_35D0_40d1_90B0_40901CB4EA94">ADEOfAbstractFeature</a> &#xAB;DataType&#xBB;</p>
</td><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="75.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_9fa107a3-d5e0-97c0-b89a-9af669ff6613" id="_9fa107a3-d5e0-97c0-b89a-9af669ff6613"></a>ADEOfAbstractFeature acts as a hook to define properties within an ADE that are to be added to AbstractFeature.</p>
