</td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="25.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_bf559d74-efd3-65eb-c77d-2509f8a7b8cf" id="_bf559d74-efd3-65eb-c77d-2509f8a7b8cf"></a><a href="#section-EAID_A710995F_4F88_44fd_A7E5_7AFE86EBEEAF">ADEOfAbstractLogicalSpace</a> &#xAB;DataType&#xBB;</p>
</td><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="75.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_310cbe0f-ad73-db49-84b3-e525b6cf044d" id="_310cbe0f-ad73-db49-84b3-e525b6cf044d"></a>ADEOfAbstractLogicalSpace acts as a hook to define properties within an ADE that are to be added to AbstractLogicalSpace.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="25.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_83274133-dcb4-f50f-554b-2cda4ee67702" id="_83274133-dcb4-f50f-554b-2cda4ee67702"></a><a href="#section-EAID_0F8C892E_3C40_4220_93AF_566A4186963D">ADEOfAbstractOccupiedSpace</a> &#xAB;DataType&#xBB;</p>
</td><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="75.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_238f9811-d857-4cc7-f548-ccc55a348d5f" id="_238f9811-d857-4cc7-f548-ccc55a348d5f"></a>ADEOfAbstractOccupiedSpace acts as a hook to define properties within an ADE that are to be added to AbstractOccupiedSpace.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="25.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_57bfb91b-b810-b77f-2a40-1cc1b6452d4a" id="_57bfb91b-b810-b77f-2a40-1cc1b6452d4a"></a><a href="#section-EAID_2A8912BA_FA90_473a_A276_8B249048D1B1">ADEOfAbstractPhysicalSpace</a> &#xAB;DataType&#xBB;</p>
