</p>
</div>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="25.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_4e8f6a51-eb36-12ad-7ce5-b4cc61eacbb7" id="_4e8f6a51-eb36-12ad-7ce5-b4cc61eacbb7"></a>GenericUnoccupiedSpace</p>
</td><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="75.0%"><div class="ul_wrap" style="page-break-after:auto"><p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo23;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="_f1251a55-d5ef-ada6-2ab1-00c152dbd32b" id="_f1251a55-d5ef-ada6-2ab1-00c152dbd32b"></a>Core::ClosureSurface
</p>
