</td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="25.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_7dd66167-1065-8959-05be-6fe7376ca344" id="_7dd66167-1065-8959-05be-6fe7376ca344"></a><a href="#section-EAID_376378FD_2413_437a_A261_21C501AD556C">CodeAttribute</a> &#xAB;DataType&#xBB;</p>
</td><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="75.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_9a4f6254-fa58-5eb0-fd85-729eb80db7f3" id="_9a4f6254-fa58-5eb0-fd85-729eb80db7f3"></a>CodeAttribute is a data type used to define generic attributes of type &#x201C;Code&#x201D;.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="25.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_09672598-e8ab-5e48-2b46-b97d9e8d2dd2" id="_09672598-e8ab-5e48-2b46-b97d9e8d2dd2"></a><a href="#section-EAID_9DB352E0_6C50_46af_8AD0_0FFFFFFB2C6A">DateAttribute</a> &#xAB;DataType&#xBB;</p>
