<div><a name="_d1b2b326-68ff-e197-d3a1-429be0276451" id="_d1b2b326-68ff-e197-d3a1-429be0276451"></a><h3>7.18.3.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Additional Information</h3>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_4a6e148a-2d68-0c13-36a8-2308bca34244" id="_4a6e148a-2d68-0c13-36a8-2308bca34244"></a>Additional information about the Tunnel Module can be found in the <a href="http://docs.opengeospatial.org/DRAFTS/20-066.html#ug-model-tunnel-section">OGC CityGML 3.0 Users Guide</a>.</p>
</div>
</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a name="data-dictionary-section" id="data-dictionary-section"></a>
        <h1>8.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>CityGML Data Dictionary</h1>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_aff1c313-5ffe-db70-a096-25827b046705" id="_aff1c313-5ffe-db70-a096-25827b046705"></a>The CityGML UML model is the normative definition of the CityGML Conceptual Model. The Data Dictionary tables in this section were software generated from the UML model. As such, this section provides a normative representation of the CityGML Conceptual Model.</p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_33f1c4d2-f6ed-e7cc-d940-dc19e01b8a3d" id="_33f1c4d2-f6ed-e7cc-d940-dc19e01b8a3d"></a>An alternate representation can be found in the Conceptual Model in <a href="#conceptual-model-section">Clause 7</a>.</p>
        <div class="figure"><a name="data-dictionary-package-diagram" id="data-dictionary-package-diagram"></a>

<p class="figure" style="page-break-after:avoid;"><img src="cid:33ad3417-874f-41f6-ad6c-8c5d3226b403.png" height="433" width="489"/></p><p class="FigureTitle" style="text-align:center;">Figure 70&#xA0;&#x2014; CityGML UML Packages</p></div>
        <div><a name="ISO-classes-dd" id="ISO-classes-dd"></a><h2>8.1.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>ISO Classes</h2>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_f1625b7d-47b1-c5d0-2784-0cc0ed919658" id="_f1625b7d-47b1-c5d0-2784-0cc0ed919658"></a>The following classes are defined in ISO standards and used by the CityGML Conceptual Model.</p>

<div><a name="AnyFeature-section" id="AnyFeature-section"></a><h3>8.1.1.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>AnyFeature (from <a href="#iso19109">ISO&#xA0;19109:2015</a>)</h3>

