</td><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;" width="63.158%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_27bffccc-b4ed-231a-94fa-05a251282830" id="_27bffccc-b4ed-231a-94fa-05a251282830"></a>Relates to a 3D Point geometry that represents the base point of the object in the world coordinate system.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;" width="15.7894%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_cc39ecbe-b035-de76-f78d-33c48b7c68c6" id="_cc39ecbe-b035-de76-f78d-33c48b7c68c6"></a>AbstractAppearance</p>
