<div><a name="section-EAID_72DAA46C_2E21_4757_A6B2_DEFB101333E4" id="section-EAID_72DAA46C_2E21_4757_A6B2_DEFB101333E4"></a><h4>8.16.1.5.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>BridgeInstallation</h4>

<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 662&#xA0;&#x2014; Metadata of BridgeInstallation (&#xAB;FeatureType&#xBB;)</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_117a3bdf-4d99-c345-767a-3bd2626456f8" id="_117a3bdf-4d99-c345-767a-3bd2626456f8"></a><colgroup><col width="20%"/><col width="80%"/></colgroup><tbody><tr><th valign="middle" align="left" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;" width="20.0%">Definition:</th><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;" width="80.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_9a89301a-1523-e89d-2df4-83dc4f810bed" id="_9a89301a-1523-e89d-2df4-83dc4f810bed"></a>A BridgeInstallation is a permanent part of a Bridge (inside and/or outside) which does not have the significance of a BridgePart. In contrast to BridgeConstructiveElements, a BridgeInstallation is not essential from a structural point of view. Examples are stairs, antennas or railways.</p>
</td></tr><tr><th valign="middle" align="left" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;" width="20.0%">Subclass of:</th><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;" width="80.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_18522bfe-b4ee-4b18-9130-3f25f0c12fd8" id="_18522bfe-b4ee-4b18-9130-3f25f0c12fd8"></a>None</p>
