<div><a name="section-EAID_FA6B6E1E_5B2A_4999_A5B5_E604A7521252" id="section-EAID_FA6B6E1E_5B2A_4999_A5B5_E604A7521252"></a><h4>8.16.1.7.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>BridgeRoom</h4>

<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 668&#xA0;&#x2014; Metadata of BridgeRoom (&#xAB;FeatureType&#xBB;)</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_cc3c635b-0551-13fc-2989-04f5db308dbf" id="_cc3c635b-0551-13fc-2989-04f5db308dbf"></a><colgroup><col width="20%"/><col width="80%"/></colgroup><tbody><tr><th valign="middle" align="left" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;" width="20.0%">Definition:</th><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;" width="80.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_168c191d-9cac-631b-df10-e9917a09fe4a" id="_168c191d-9cac-631b-df10-e9917a09fe4a"></a>A BridgeRoom is a space within a Bridge or BridgePart intended for human occupancy (e.g. a place of work or recreation) and/or containment (storage) of animals or things. A BridgeRoom is bounded physically and/or virtually (e.g. by ClosureSurfaces or GenericSurfaces).</p>
</td></tr><tr><th valign="middle" align="left" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;" width="20.0%">Subclass of:</th><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;" width="80.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_83cd9ce0-8d30-2001-40dd-dcf1e22acd2c" id="_83cd9ce0-8d30-2001-40dd-dcf1e22acd2c"></a>None</p>
