</p><p style="mso-list:l2 level2 lfo100;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Validate that the data element has the same relationships with other elements as those defined for the UML class. Validate that those relationships have the same source, target, direction, roles, and multiplicies as those documented in the Conceptual Model.
